Package: craftos-desktop
Version: 0.1
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: nu-stats <j.stowell@northeastern.edu>
Depends: r-base, python3
Recommends: statcraft, rcraft, qualcraft, egocraft, mapcraft, husky-eye-view, husky-merge, husky-explorer, heic-converter, craft-keys
Description: CraftOS desktop metapackage
 Pulls in the Craft suite of research apps from the nu-stats organisation
 and the shared toolchain they need. Apps are Recommends so the image still
 builds while some apps have no .deb yet.
